    "body": "I enjoy to read the history that made the current version to be possible. Yeah, is not my business, but if I read an example from W3C or WHATWG then I'll feel more confident when coding. And Custom Elements in my opinion is: the beginning of the frameworks' end.\nPlease, don't remove the examples, the author's opinions or similar. Every word matters! Even if it sounds like a tutorial.\n",
